Z||000016||ChopTop||03-13-2001||06:18 PM||||I'll go with the IMSA look, but I like the original race design over the street design.  With the kit they lowered the beltline (the ribbing that goes around the body) I'm assuming the reason was too help conceal the cavernous look the Fiero wheel wells have.  If I got the kit I think I'd enlarge the wheel wells to more closely resemble the race design.   ||||reg||1
